on.","repository":{"path":"./runtime/examples/dummy-markdown-dag-3","base_branch":"main"},"policy":{"max_workers":3},"tasks":[{"task_id":"source","title":"Specify source records","description":"List fields and provenance for synthetic records.","estimate_minutes":2.0,"depends_on":[],"acceptance_criteria":["The field list and synthetic provenance are stated."]},{"task_id":"assets","title":"Specify illustration assets","description":"List placeholder illustrations independently of the source records.","estimate_minutes":3.0,"depends_on":[],"acceptance_criteria":["Every placeholder has a name and purpose."]},{"task_id":"draft","title":"Specify article outline","description":"Organize the synthetic source records into sections.","estimate_minutes":5.0,"depends_on":["source"],"acceptance_criteria":["Each section has an explicit source field."]},{"task_id":"audit","title":"Specify record checks","description":"Describe validation checks for the synthetic records.","estimate_minutes":4.0,"depends_on":["source"],"acceptance_criteria":["Missing and malformed values have explicit checks."]},{"task_id":"captions","title":"Specify captions","description":"Pair illustration placeholders with section captions.","estimate_minutes":2.0,"depends_on":["assets","draft"],"acceptance_criteria":["Every placeholder has a matching caption."]},{"task_id":"review","title":"Review combined outline","description":"Compare the outline, record checks, and captions.","estimate_minutes":3.0,"depends_on":["draft","audit","captions"],"acceptance_criteria":["The review references all three preceding specifications."]},{"task_id":"publish","title":"Specify publication handoff","description":"Summarize a handoff checklist for the reviewed synthetic outline.","estimate_minutes":2.0,"depends_on":["review"],"acceptance_criteria":["The handoff checklist references the review."]}]},"source_text":"# Scheduler project intake v1\n\nProject ID: dummy-markdown-dag-3\nProject name: Multi-branch dependency sample\nRepository path: ./runtime/examples/dummy-markdown-dag-3\nBase branch: main\nMaximum workers: 3\n\n## Description\nDescribe a synthetic publication workflow with two independent starting tasks, a fork, and a three-way join. Simulation completes task receipts without producing a publication.\n\n## Tasks\n\n### source: Specify source records\nDescription: List fields and provenance for synthetic records.\nEstimate minutes: 2\nDepends on: none\nAcceptance criteria:\n- The field list and synthetic provenance are stated.\n\n### assets: Specify illustration assets\nDescription: List placeholder illustrations independently of the source records.\nEstimate minutes: 3\nDepends on: none\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Every placeholder has a name and purpose.\n\n### draft: Specify article outline\nDescription: Organize the synthetic source records into sections.\nEstimate minutes: 5\nDepends on: source\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Each section has an explicit source field.\n\n### audit: Specify record checks\nDescription: Describe validation checks for the synthetic records.\nEstimate minutes: 4\nDepends on: source\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Missing and malformed values have explicit checks.\n\n### captions: Specify captions\nDescription: Pair illustration placeholders with section captions.\nEstimate minutes: 2\nDepends on: assets, draft\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Every placeholder has a matching caption.\n\n### review: Review combined outline\nDescription: Compare the outline, record checks, and captions.\nEstimate minutes: 3\nDepends on: draft, audit, captions\nAcceptance criteria:\n- The review references all three preceding specifications.\n\n### publish: Specify publication handoff\nDescription: Summarize a handoff checklist for the reviewed synthetic outline.\nEstimate minutes: 2\nDepends on: review\nAcceptance criteria:\n- The handoff checklist references the review.\n","filename":"intake-template.md","request_sha256":"535e25fd476e08b4c5a9d057fa949f6a409ed4a0ce255294f00ee606e7c7529a"}